 "headline": "Tatum Torches Thug Life; Knicks Flatline",
 "notes": [
  "Jayson Tatum dropped 34, 9 assists and 5 threes for theInfamous, and Thug Life is staring up at a 6-5 deficit anyway.",
  "Kyshawn George hung 33 on 10-of-19 shooting for Zero Fox Given, while CJ McCollum went 1-of-10 and set fire to the efficiency gains.",
  "Nova Knicks got 30 and 14 from Victor Wembanyama, then watched Coby White go 1-for-8 and Dylan Cardwell fall flat in a 2-8 hole.",
  "Naji Marshall and Caleb Wilson are rotting on the Nova Knicks bench while the starters bleed out against Suggs to be you.",
  "Gopher Gold's 6-5 lead over White Mambas shrank to 6-4 overnight, and FG% is the only thing keeping anyone breathing."
 ],
